# Local configuration names a real bucket; keep it out of the repo.
config.json

# Never commit credentials. The scripts read them from the environment only.
.env
*.pem
credentials
aws_credentials*

# NOTE: evidence/transcripts/, evidence/state.json and evidence/logs/ were
# initially excluded here on privacy grounds. That was reconsidered and they
# are now committed deliberately: they are the assessment's primary evidence
# (101 test transcripts, live resource state, invocation log samples), the
# corpus behind them is Udacity's synthetic sample data, the ns_live_... token
# in it is fake, the AWS account was torn down on completion, and the account
# ID already appears in every committed document — so excluding them was
# inconsistent as well as weakening the submission.
